                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-8">See Craig and Kachovec (2019).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-8" aria-label="Return from footnote 8.">Return to 8</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-9">Brainard (December 18, 2019).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-9" aria-label="Return from footnote 9.">Return to 9</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-10">See Craig and Kachovec (2019).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-10" aria-label="Return from footnote 10.">Return to 10</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-11">For informative overviews of stablecoins, including their benefits and challenges, see Bank for International Settlements (October 2019 and December 2019), Financial Stability Board (October 10, 2018; June 6, 2019; and October 18, 2019), Brainard (October 16, 2019 and December 18, 2019), and Evans (2019).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-11" aria-label="Return from footnote 11.">Return to 11</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-12">Powell (July 10, 2019).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-12" aria-label="Return from footnote 12.">Return to 12</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-13">Powell (November 19, 2019) discusses the Fed&rsquo;s view on this subject.  Also see Brainard (September 16, 2019, and December 18, 2019), and Evans (2019).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-13" aria-label="Return from footnote 13.">Return to 13</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-14">See Boar, Holden, and Wadsworth (2020)
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-14" aria-label="Return from footnote 14.">Return to 14</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-15">Information on the Swedish central bank&rsquo;s e-krona project is available on its website at <a target="_blank" class="offsite" href="https://www.riksbank.se/en-gb/payments--cash/e-krona/">https://www.riksbank.se/en-gb/payments--cash/e-krona/</a>.  See also Sveriges Riksbank (2018) for several articles on the e-krona, the Riksbank&rsquo;s potential digital currency.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-15" aria-label="Return from footnote 15.">Return to 15</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-16">See Official Monetary and Financial Institutions Forum (2019).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-16" aria-label="Return from footnote 16.">Return to 16</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-17">See Rogoff (2016) and Bordo and Levin (2017).
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-17" aria-label="Return from footnote 17.">Return to 17</a>
                    </li>
        </ol>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="component notes col-12">
        <div class="component-content">
